/target

# Vendored crate sources, kept out of the tree.
/.cargo/registry
/.cargo/git

# Store files. `lepatch backup <dir> <base>` writes `<base>.NNNN.bin`,
# `<base>.vNNNN.idx` and `<base>.lock` into the *current directory* when the base
# is a bare name, and a test that runs the binary without setting a working
# directory leaves one here. `git add -A` will otherwise commit one, and a
# committed `photos.0000.bin` is a 12-byte store header that looks like data.
*.NNNN.bin
*.vNNNN.idx
